  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Supporting sustainable management of endangered tree species and conservation of the African Elephant</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Trough CITES (Convention on International Trade in Endangered Species of Wild Fauna and Flora) secretariat, and AEF (African Elephant Fund) secretariat, implementation, by beneficiary countries, of activities allowing sustainable trade of valuable tree species listed in Annex 2 of CITES; and improving elephant conservation.</narrative>
  </description>
